    {
      "id": "s01-flow",
      "intent": "The recurrence returns to the DQ-CTM thought stage, while the carrier continues through the end-to-end flow.",
      "claim": "ThinkSR end to end: encoder, windows, shared DQ-CTM ticks, decoder.",
      "narration": "The image first becomes a dense carrier, so spatial detail is present before the compact thought process begins. Windows organize that carrier for the recurrent DQ-CTM step. The loop returns only to the thought stage, with parameters shared across ticks. Decoding happens after the recurrent updates, not on every pass through the whole flow.",
